# Wireframe: Issue Detail — Comment Editing

## Purpose & Flow Context

Lets the comment author edit their own comment inline on the issue detail page. Entry: click edit pencil on own CommentCard. Exit: save updates the body in-place; cancel returns to display mode.

---

## Notation Legend

| Symbol | Meaning | Symbol | Meaning |
|--------|---------|--------|---------|
| `[...]` | Button / interactive element | `[>...▼]` | Dropdown |
| `_______` | Text input / editable field | `[X]` | Close / dismiss |
| `[p]` | Pencil icon (edit) | `💬N` | N comments |

---

## Layout Regions

**Grid**: 12-column layout. Spacing cadence: 8px rhythm.

**App-shell**: Shared header + sidebar + content container (existing). The comment list lives in the main content region of Issue Detail.

**Content hierarchy** (comment section only):
1. Comment count heading
2. Comment cards (each with avatar, author, body, edit affordance)
3. In edit mode: textarea replaces body, save + cancel replace edit pencil

