---

## Components & Affordances

| Element | DS Component | Behavior | Edge Cases |
|---------|-------------|----------|------------|
| Edit button | Button (tertiary, sm) with `[p]` icon | Visible only when `comment.authorId === currentUserId`. Click → card enters edit mode. `aria-label="Edit comment"` | — |
| Textarea | Textarea editor | Pre-filled with current body, auto-focused. Min height: 3 rows. | Empty body on save → validation error (frontend), PATCH 400 (backend) |
| Save button | Button (primary, sm) | Calls `updateComment()`. Disabled + spinner during save. `aria-label="Save comment"` | Error → preserve text, re-enable |
| Cancel button | Button (ghost, sm) | Discards edits, restores original body, exits edit mode. Also triggered by Escape. `aria-label="Cancel edit"` | Same as click |

---

## States

### Populated — Display Mode

As shown in sketch above. Each comment card shows avatar, name, timestamp, body. Edit pencil visible on own comments.

### Populated — Edit Mode

One comment at a time in edit mode. Textarea replaces body paragraph; save + cancel replace edit pencil. Other comments unaffected.

### Saving

Save button shows spinner, both buttons and textarea disabled. Card visual stays in edit-mode layout but inert.

### Error after Save

Error toast appears at top. Textarea stays open with unsaved edits. Save button re-enabled. Cancel still available.

### Loading (Comments)

Skeleton cards (existing pattern — unchanged by this feature).

### Empty (No Comments)

Existing EmptyState — unchanged by this feature.

### Error (Comments Load Failed)

Existing ErrorBanner — unchanged by this feature.

---

## Responsive

| Breakpoint | Changes |
|------------|---------|
| Desktop (>1024px) | Full layout as described |
| Tablet (768-1024px) | No change — single-column comments layout remains |
| Mobile (<768px) | Save/cancel buttons stack vertically if textarea is full width; touch targets ≥44px |

---

## Accessibility — Screen Composition

| Concern | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Landmarks | Inherits from Issue Detail page (`main`) |
| Heading order | h3 "Comments (N)" — already existing |
| Reading / Focus order | Edit pencil → focus moves to textarea on edit mode open; Tab from textarea → Save → Cancel; on cancel focus returns to edit pencil; on save focus stays on comment card |
| Accessible names | Edit button `aria-label="Edit comment"`, Save `aria-label="Save comment"`, Cancel `aria-label="Cancel edit"` |
| Keyboard operability | Enter/Space on edit pencil → open edit mode; Tab through textarea → Save → Cancel → next comment; Escape → cancel edit |
| Target size | ≥24×24 CSS px on edit pencil; ≥44×44 on save/cancel (mobile) |
| Non-color intent | Edit pencil icon + text intent; save/cancel use text labels not color only |
